## Key Commands

### Scanning for trouble
```bash
ls -rt {{ .TownRoot }}/logs/sessions/ | tail -n 5
tail -n 100 {{ .TownRoot }}/logs/sessions/<agent-log-file>
```

### Investigating a workspace
```bash
find {{ .TownRoot }}/<rig> -name "SPEC.md" -o -name "SimpleSpec.md"
```

### Communication
```bash
{{ cmd }} nudge <target> "I've created a symlink for the spec you were looking for. Try again."
```

